      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 13:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Kä ɛn cäŋ ɛmɔ ba dhɔr Dee-bid kɛnɛ ji̱ Jɛ-ru-tha-lɛm lëp waŋ pi̱i̱ni ti ba dueerkiɛn kɛnɛ thil gɔɔyädiɛn lak.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.13.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.13.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 13:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.13.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.13.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 13:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä ɛn cäŋ ɛmɔ, cu Kuoth Nhial in la Ruey Ɣɔaa wee i̱, “Ɣän bä kolaaŋ woc wi̱i̱ muɔ̱ɔ̱n, kä /ci kɛn kɛ bi lɛ met tim. Kä ɣän bä go̱o̱k guäyni kɛnɛ nɛy tin tekɛ yi̱ey ti jiäk woc bä. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.13.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.13.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 13:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä mi wëë tekɛ gök mi wä jɔɔc, bi gua̱n kɛnɛ man, tin dapkɛ jɛ, jɛ jiök i̱, ‘Ji̱n /ci bi tëk kɛ ɣöö ci kac lat kɛ ciöt Kuɔth Nhial.’ Kä mi wëë nyin go̱o̱kä la̱t, bi diëëthkɛ jɛ yiath a bɛ li̱w. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.13.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.13.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 13:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ɛn cäŋ ɛmɔ, bɛ thil gök mi liak rɔ kɛ nyuuthnikɛ ti la nyin go̱o̱kä. Kä /cɛ ruac go̱o̱kä mi kaŋɛ naath bi lɛ la̱t, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.13.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.13.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 13:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kä bɛ wee i̱, ‘/Ciɛ ɣän gök, ɛ ɣän puur muɔ̱ɔ̱n. Kɛ ɣöö min ɛ jɛn la duŋdä mɔ ni mëë ɛ ɣän ŋuɛ̈t.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.13.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.13.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 13:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä mi wä raan ɛ thiec i̱, ‘Kä kɛ buɔ̱ɔ̱t ŋukä, ti te jɔɔkdɛ ti?’ Bɛ loc i̱, ‘Kɛ buɔ̱ɔ̱t ti jëkä dhɔr määthdä.’ ”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.13.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.13.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Lär kɛ näk yieen deet Kuɔth Nhial",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
